    "Workers block on bus socket (Unix domain socket); zero CPU when idle.",
    "Each event has dot-namespaced name + typed payload + ts field.",
    "Workers register subscription lists; bus delivers matching events.",
    "Worker decision trivium: yes / no / escalate. Escalation flows up symmetric CEO chain (Wren / Hermes / Claude).",
    "Bus journals last N events to mmap'd file for cross-session replay (DeepSeek)."
